    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Retained for whole-wall equilibrium; carried by the wall, not the ring [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0379 = v_0377*(Abs(v_0378) + v_0011)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0379 = v_0377*(Abs(v_0378) + v_0011)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 25.312</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Superseded tributary-eccentricity basis (D-070); comparison only [kip-in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0380 = v_0343*v_0107*v_0112*Abs(v_0371 - v_0109)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0380 = v_0343*v_0107*v_0112*Abs(v_0371 - v_0109)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.121</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Rigid-body axial redistribution; sign taken to increase the ring force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0381 = v_0377 + v_0380" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0381 = v_0377 + v_0380</expbody>
        <expresult> = 8.558</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 2 design force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0382 = v_0114/v_0381" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0382 = v_0114/v_0381</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.631</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Compare with the kern limit [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0383 = v_0381/v_0073" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0383 = v_0381/v_0073</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.105</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 2 qavg [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0384 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0384 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.013</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 2 qmoment [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0385 = v_0383 + v_0384" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0385 = v_0383 + v_0384</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.118</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 2 qmax [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0386 = v_0383 - v_0384" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0386 = v_0383 - v_0384</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.092</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 2 qmin [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0387 = v_0385*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0387 = v_0385*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.140</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Peak pressure over full radial strip [kip-in/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0388 = v_0385*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0388 = v_0385*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.153</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 2 root shear [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0389 = Sqrt(6*v_0387/(v_0040*v_0035))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0389 = Sqrt(6*v_0387/(v_0040*v_0035))</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.130</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 2 thickness bending [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0390 = v_0388/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0390 = v_0388/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.005</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 2 thickness shear [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0391 = Max(v_0389, v_0390, v_0037 + 0.0625)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0391 = Max(v_0389, v_0390, v_0037 + 0.0625)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.375</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Bending, shear and conservative weld-edge allowance; revise/recalculate after selecting thickness [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0392 = v_0387/v_0034" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0392 = v_0387/v_0034</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.280</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Top/bottom weld couple separated conservatively by plate thickness [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0393 = Sqrt((v_0388/2)^2 + v_0392^2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0393 = Sqrt((v_0388/2)^2 + v_0392^2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.290</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Per fillet: half vertical shear + full radial couple force [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0394 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0393/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0394 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0393/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.075</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 2 weld strength leg [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0395 = Max(v_0394, v_0085)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0395 = Max(v_0394, v_0085)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Strength and minimum detailing; revise/recalculate after selecting weld [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0396 = Round(16*v_0395, 0)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0396 = Round(16*v_0395, 0)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 4.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Nearest whole number of sixteenths [—]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0397 = If(v_0396 &gt;= 16*v_0395, v_0396, v_0396 + 1)/16" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0397 = If(v_0396 &gt;= 16*v_0395, v_0396, v_0396 + 1)/16</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Trial leg rounded up to the next 1/16 in [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0398 = v_0092 + (3 - 1)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0398 = v_0092 + (3 - 1)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 139.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 x [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0399 = v_0092 + (3 - 1.5)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0399 = v_0092 + (3 - 1.5)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 109.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 lo [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0400 = v_0092 + (3 - 0.5)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0400 = v_0092 + (3 - 0.5)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 169.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 hi [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0401 = v_0400 - v_0399" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0401 = v_0400 - v_0399</expbody>
        <expresult> = 60.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 width [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0402 = v_0401*v_0342*v_0003/1728" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0402 = v_0401*v_0342*v_0003/1728</expbody>
        <expresult> = 45.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 volume [ft³]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0403 = v_0021*v_0402" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0403 = v_0021*v_0402</expbody>
        <expresult> = 6.750</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 service [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0404 = v_0022*v_0403" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0404 = v_0022*v_0403</expbody>
        <expresult> = 8.438</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0405 = (v_0399 + v_0400)/2 - v_0398" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0405 = (v_0399 + v_0400)/2 - v_0398</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Retained for whole-wall equilibrium; carried by the wall, not the ring [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0406 = v_0404*(Abs(v_0405) + v_0011)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0406 = v_0404*(Abs(v_0405) + v_0011)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 25.312</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Superseded tributary-eccentricity basis (D-070); comparison only [kip-in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0407 = v_0343*v_0107*v_0112*Abs(v_0398 - v_0109)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0407 = v_0343*v_0107*v_0112*Abs(v_0398 - v_0109)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.121</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Rigid-body axial redistribution; sign taken to increase the ring force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0408 = v_0404 + v_0407" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0408 = v_0404 + v_0407</expbody>
        <expresult> = 8.558</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 design force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0409 = v_0114/v_0408" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0409 = v_0114/v_0408</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.631</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Compare with the kern limit [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0410 = v_0408/v_0073" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0410 = v_0408/v_0073</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.105</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 qavg [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0411 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0411 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.013</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 qmoment [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0412 = v_0410 + v_0411" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0412 = v_0410 + v_0411</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.118</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 qmax [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0413 = v_0410 - v_0411" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0413 = v_0410 - v_0411</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.092</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 qmin [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0414 = v_0412*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0414 = v_0412*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.140</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Peak pressure over full radial strip [kip-in/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0415 = v_0412*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0415 = v_0412*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.153</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 root shear [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0416 = Sqrt(6*v_0414/(v_0040*v_0035))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0416 = Sqrt(6*v_0414/(v_0040*v_0035))</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.130</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 thickness bending [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0417 = v_0415/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0417 = v_0415/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.005</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 thickness shear [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0418 = Max(v_0416, v_0417, v_0037 + 0.0625)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0418 = Max(v_0416, v_0417, v_0037 + 0.0625)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.375</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Bending, shear and conservative weld-edge allowance; revise/recalculate after selecting thickness [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0419 = v_0414/v_0034" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0419 = v_0414/v_0034</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.280</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Top/bottom weld couple separated conservatively by plate thickness [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0420 = Sqrt((v_0415/2)^2 + v_0419^2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0420 = Sqrt((v_0415/2)^2 + v_0419^2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.290</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Per fillet: half vertical shear + full radial couple force [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0421 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0420/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0421 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0420/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.075</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 3 weld strength leg [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0422 = Max(v_0421, v_0085)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0422 = Max(v_0421, v_0085)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Strength and minimum detailing; revise/recalculate after selecting weld [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0423 = Round(16*v_0422, 0)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0423 = Round(16*v_0422, 0)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 4.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Nearest whole number of sixteenths [—]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0424 = If(v_0423 &gt;= 16*v_0422, v_0423, v_0423 + 1)/16" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0424 = If(v_0423 &gt;= 16*v_0422, v_0423, v_0423 + 1)/16</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Trial leg rounded up to the next 1/16 in [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0425 = v_0092 + (4 - 1)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0425 = v_0092 + (4 - 1)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 199.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 3 4 x [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0426 = v_0092 + (4 - 1.5)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0426 = v_0092 + (4 - 1.5)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 169.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
