    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Compare with the kern limit [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0522 = v_0520/v_0073" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0522 = v_0520/v_0073</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.105</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 3 qavg [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0523 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0523 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.013</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 3 qmoment [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0524 = v_0522 + v_0523" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0524 = v_0522 + v_0523</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.118</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 3 qmax [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0525 = v_0522 - v_0523" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0525 = v_0522 - v_0523</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.092</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 3 qmin [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0526 = v_0524*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0526 = v_0524*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.140</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Peak pressure over full radial strip [kip-in/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0527 = v_0524*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0527 = v_0524*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.153</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 3 root shear [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0528 = Sqrt(6*v_0526/(v_0040*v_0035))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0528 = Sqrt(6*v_0526/(v_0040*v_0035))</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.130</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 3 thickness bending [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0529 = v_0527/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0529 = v_0527/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.005</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 3 thickness shear [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0530 = Max(v_0528, v_0529, v_0037 + 0.0625)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0530 = Max(v_0528, v_0529, v_0037 + 0.0625)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.375</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Bending, shear and conservative weld-edge allowance; revise/recalculate after selecting thickness [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0531 = v_0526/v_0034" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0531 = v_0526/v_0034</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.280</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Top/bottom weld couple separated conservatively by plate thickness [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0532 = Sqrt((v_0527/2)^2 + v_0531^2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0532 = Sqrt((v_0527/2)^2 + v_0531^2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.290</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Per fillet: half vertical shear + full radial couple force [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0533 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0532/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0533 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0532/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.075</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 3 weld strength leg [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0534 = Max(v_0533, v_0085)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0534 = Max(v_0533, v_0085)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Strength and minimum detailing; revise/recalculate after selecting weld [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0535 = Round(16*v_0534, 0)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0535 = Round(16*v_0534, 0)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 4.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Nearest whole number of sixteenths [—]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0536 = If(v_0535 &gt;= 16*v_0534, v_0535, v_0535 + 1)/16" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0536 = If(v_0535 &gt;= 16*v_0534, v_0535, v_0535 + 1)/16</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Trial leg rounded up to the next 1/16 in [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0537 = v_0092 + (4 - 1)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0537 = v_0092 + (4 - 1)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 199.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 x [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0538 = v_0092 + (4 - 1.5)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0538 = v_0092 + (4 - 1.5)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 169.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 lo [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0539 = v_0002" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0539 = v_0002</expbody>
        <expresult> = 219.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 hi [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0540 = v_0539 - v_0538" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0540 = v_0539 - v_0538</expbody>
        <expresult> = 49.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 width [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0541 = v_0540*v_0454*v_0003/1728" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0541 = v_0540*v_0454*v_0003/1728</expbody>
        <expresult> = 37.125</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 volume [ft³]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0542 = v_0021*v_0541" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0542 = v_0021*v_0541</expbody>
        <expresult> = 5.569</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 service [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0543 = v_0022*v_0542" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0543 = v_0022*v_0542</expbody>
        <expresult> = 6.961</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0544 = (v_0538 + v_0539)/2 - v_0537" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0544 = (v_0538 + v_0539)/2 - v_0537</expbody>
        <expresult> = -5.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Retained for whole-wall equilibrium; carried by the wall, not the ring [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0545 = v_0543*(Abs(v_0544) + v_0011)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0545 = v_0543*(Abs(v_0544) + v_0011)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 57.428</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Superseded tributary-eccentricity basis (D-070); comparison only [kip-in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0546 = v_0455*v_0107*v_0112*Abs(v_0537 - v_0109)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0546 = v_0455*v_0107*v_0112*Abs(v_0537 - v_0109)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.362</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Rigid-body axial redistribution; sign taken to increase the ring force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0547 = v_0543 + v_0546" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0547 = v_0543 + v_0546</expbody>
        <expresult> = 7.323</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 design force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0548 = v_0114/v_0547" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0548 = v_0114/v_0547</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.737</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Compare with the kern limit [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0549 = v_0547/v_0073" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0549 = v_0547/v_0073</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.090</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 qavg [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0550 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0550 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.013</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 qmoment [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0551 = v_0549 + v_0550" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0551 = v_0549 + v_0550</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.103</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 qmax [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0552 = v_0549 - v_0550" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0552 = v_0549 - v_0550</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.077</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 qmin [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0553 = v_0551*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0553 = v_0551*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.122</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Peak pressure over full radial strip [kip-in/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0554 = v_0551*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0554 = v_0551*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.133</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 root shear [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0555 = Sqrt(6*v_0553/(v_0040*v_0035))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0555 = Sqrt(6*v_0553/(v_0040*v_0035))</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.121</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 thickness bending [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0556 = v_0554/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0556 = v_0554/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.005</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 thickness shear [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0557 = Max(v_0555, v_0556, v_0037 + 0.0625)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0557 = Max(v_0555, v_0556, v_0037 + 0.0625)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.375</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Bending, shear and conservative weld-edge allowance; revise/recalculate after selecting thickness [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0558 = v_0553/v_0034" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0558 = v_0553/v_0034</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.244</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Top/bottom weld couple separated conservatively by plate thickness [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0559 = Sqrt((v_0554/2)^2 + v_0558^2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0559 = Sqrt((v_0554/2)^2 + v_0558^2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.253</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Per fillet: half vertical shear + full radial couple force [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0560 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0559/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0560 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0559/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.073</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 4 4 weld strength leg [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0561 = Max(v_0560, v_0085)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0561 = Max(v_0560, v_0085)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Strength and minimum detailing; revise/recalculate after selecting weld [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0562 = Round(16*v_0561, 0)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0562 = Round(16*v_0561, 0)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 4.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Nearest whole number of sixteenths [—]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0563 = If(v_0562 &gt;= 16*v_0561, v_0562, v_0562 + 1)/16" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0563 = If(v_0562 &gt;= 16*v_0561, v_0562, v_0562 + 1)/16</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Trial leg rounded up to the next 1/16 in [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0564 = v_0023 + (5 - 1.5)*v_0024" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0564 = v_0023 + (5 - 1.5)*v_0024</expbody>
        <expresult> = 132.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">row 5 lo [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0565 = v_0004" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0565 = v_0004</expbody>
        <expresult> = 194.863</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">row 5 hi [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0566 = v_0565 - v_0564" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0566 = v_0565 - v_0564</expbody>
        <expresult> = 62.863</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">row 5 height [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0567 = v_0566/v_0004" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0567 = v_0566/v_0004</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.323</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Row tributary fraction of the wall height [—]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0568 = v_0092 + (1 - 1)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0568 = v_0092 + (1 - 1)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 19.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 x [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0569 = 0" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0569 = 0</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 lo [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0570 = v_0092 + (1 - 0.5)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0570 = v_0092 + (1 - 0.5)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 49.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 hi [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0571 = v_0570 - v_0569" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0571 = v_0570 - v_0569</expbody>
        <expresult> = 49.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 width [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0572 = v_0571*v_0566*v_0003/1728" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0572 = v_0571*v_0566*v_0003/1728</expbody>
        <expresult> = 64.827</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 volume [ft³]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0573 = v_0021*v_0572" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0573 = v_0021*v_0572</expbody>
        <expresult> = 9.724</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 service [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0574 = v_0022*v_0573" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0574 = v_0022*v_0573</expbody>
        <expresult> = 12.155</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0575 = (v_0569 + v_0570)/2 - v_0568" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0575 = (v_0569 + v_0570)/2 - v_0568</expbody>
        <expresult> = 5.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Retained for whole-wall equilibrium; carried by the wall, not the ring [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0576 = v_0574*(Abs(v_0575) + v_0011)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0576 = v_0574*(Abs(v_0575) + v_0011)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 100.279</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Superseded tributary-eccentricity basis (D-070); comparison only [kip-in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0577 = v_0567*v_0107*v_0112*Abs(v_0568 - v_0109)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0577 = v_0567*v_0107*v_0112*Abs(v_0568 - v_0109)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.633</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Rigid-body axial redistribution; sign taken to increase the ring force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0578 = v_0574 + v_0577" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0578 = v_0574 + v_0577</expbody>
        <expresult> = 12.788</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 design force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0579 = v_0114/v_0578" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0579 = v_0114/v_0578</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.422</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Compare with the kern limit [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0580 = v_0578/v_0073" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0580 = v_0578/v_0073</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.157</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 qavg [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0581 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0581 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.013</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 qmoment [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0582 = v_0580 + v_0581" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0582 = v_0580 + v_0581</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.170</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 qmax [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0583 = v_0580 - v_0581" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0583 = v_0580 - v_0581</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.144</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 qmin [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0584 = v_0582*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0584 = v_0582*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.202</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Peak pressure over full radial strip [kip-in/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0585 = v_0582*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0585 = v_0582*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.220</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 root shear [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0586 = Sqrt(6*v_0584/(v_0040*v_0035))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0586 = Sqrt(6*v_0584/(v_0040*v_0035))</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.156</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 thickness bending [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0587 = v_0585/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0587 = v_0585/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.008</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 thickness shear [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0588 = Max(v_0586, v_0587, v_0037 + 0.0625)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0588 = Max(v_0586, v_0587, v_0037 + 0.0625)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.375</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Bending, shear and conservative weld-edge allowance; revise/recalculate after selecting thickness [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0589 = v_0584/v_0034" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0589 = v_0584/v_0034</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.404</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Top/bottom weld couple separated conservatively by plate thickness [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0590 = Sqrt((v_0585/2)^2 + v_0589^2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0590 = Sqrt((v_0585/2)^2 + v_0589^2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.418</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Per fillet: half vertical shear + full radial couple force [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0591 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0590/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0591 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0590/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.080</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 1 weld strength leg [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0592 = Max(v_0591, v_0085)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0592 = Max(v_0591, v_0085)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Strength and minimum detailing; revise/recalculate after selecting weld [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0593 = Round(16*v_0592, 0)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0593 = Round(16*v_0592, 0)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 4.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Nearest whole number of sixteenths [—]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0594 = If(v_0593 &gt;= 16*v_0592, v_0593, v_0593 + 1)/16" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0594 = If(v_0593 &gt;= 16*v_0592, v_0593, v_0593 + 1)/16</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Trial leg rounded up to the next 1/16 in [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0595 = v_0092 + (2 - 1)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0595 = v_0092 + (2 - 1)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 79.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 x [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0596 = v_0092 + (2 - 1.5)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0596 = v_0092 + (2 - 1.5)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 49.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 lo [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0597 = v_0092 + (2 - 0.5)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0597 = v_0092 + (2 - 0.5)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 109.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 hi [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0598 = v_0597 - v_0596" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0598 = v_0597 - v_0596</expbody>
        <expresult> = 60.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 width [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0599 = v_0598*v_0566*v_0003/1728" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0599 = v_0598*v_0566*v_0003/1728</expbody>
        <expresult> = 78.578</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 volume [ft³]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0600 = v_0021*v_0599" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0600 = v_0021*v_0599</expbody>
        <expresult> = 11.787</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 service [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0601 = v_0022*v_0600" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0601 = v_0022*v_0600</expbody>
        <expresult> = 14.733</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0602 = (v_0596 + v_0597)/2 - v_0595" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0602 = (v_0596 + v_0597)/2 - v_0595</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Retained for whole-wall equilibrium; carried by the wall, not the ring [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0603 = v_0601*(Abs(v_0602) + v_0011)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0603 = v_0601*(Abs(v_0602) + v_0011)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 44.200</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Superseded tributary-eccentricity basis (D-070); comparison only [kip-in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0604 = v_0567*v_0107*v_0112*Abs(v_0595 - v_0109)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0604 = v_0567*v_0107*v_0112*Abs(v_0595 - v_0109)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.211</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Rigid-body axial redistribution; sign taken to increase the ring force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0605 = v_0601 + v_0604" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0605 = v_0601 + v_0604</expbody>
        <expresult> = 14.944</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 design force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0606 = v_0114/v_0605" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0606 = v_0114/v_0605</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.361</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Compare with the kern limit [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0607 = v_0605/v_0073" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0607 = v_0605/v_0073</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.184</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 qavg [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0608 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0608 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.013</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 qmoment [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0609 = v_0607 + v_0608" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0609 = v_0607 + v_0608</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.196</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 qmax [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0610 = v_0607 - v_0608" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0610 = v_0607 - v_0608</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.171</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 qmin [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0611 = v_0609*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0611 = v_0609*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.233</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Peak pressure over full radial strip [kip-in/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0612 = v_0609*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0612 = v_0609*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.254</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 root shear [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0613 = Sqrt(6*v_0611/(v_0040*v_0035))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0613 = Sqrt(6*v_0611/(v_0040*v_0035))</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.167</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 thickness bending [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0614 = v_0612/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0614 = v_0612/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.009</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 thickness shear [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0615 = Max(v_0613, v_0614, v_0037 + 0.0625)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0615 = Max(v_0613, v_0614, v_0037 + 0.0625)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.375</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Bending, shear and conservative weld-edge allowance; revise/recalculate after selecting thickness [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0616 = v_0611/v_0034" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0616 = v_0611/v_0034</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.467</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Top/bottom weld couple separated conservatively by plate thickness [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0617 = Sqrt((v_0612/2)^2 + v_0616^2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0617 = Sqrt((v_0612/2)^2 + v_0616^2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.484</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Per fillet: half vertical shear + full radial couple force [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0618 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0617/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0618 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0617/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.083</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 2 weld strength leg [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0619 = Max(v_0618, v_0085)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0619 = Max(v_0618, v_0085)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Strength and minimum detailing; revise/recalculate after selecting weld [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0620 = Round(16*v_0619, 0)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0620 = Round(16*v_0619, 0)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 4.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Nearest whole number of sixteenths [—]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0621 = If(v_0620 &gt;= 16*v_0619, v_0620, v_0620 + 1)/16" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0621 = If(v_0620 &gt;= 16*v_0619, v_0620, v_0620 + 1)/16</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Trial leg rounded up to the next 1/16 in [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0622 = v_0092 + (3 - 1)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0622 = v_0092 + (3 - 1)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 139.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 x [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0623 = v_0092 + (3 - 1.5)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0623 = v_0092 + (3 - 1.5)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 109.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 lo [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0624 = v_0092 + (3 - 0.5)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0624 = v_0092 + (3 - 0.5)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 169.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 hi [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0625 = v_0624 - v_0623" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0625 = v_0624 - v_0623</expbody>
        <expresult> = 60.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 width [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0626 = v_0625*v_0566*v_0003/1728" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0626 = v_0625*v_0566*v_0003/1728</expbody>
        <expresult> = 78.578</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 volume [ft³]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0627 = v_0021*v_0626" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0627 = v_0021*v_0626</expbody>
        <expresult> = 11.787</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 service [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0628 = v_0022*v_0627" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0628 = v_0022*v_0627</expbody>
        <expresult> = 14.733</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0629 = (v_0623 + v_0624)/2 - v_0622" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0629 = (v_0623 + v_0624)/2 - v_0622</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Retained for whole-wall equilibrium; carried by the wall, not the ring [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0630 = v_0628*(Abs(v_0629) + v_0011)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0630 = v_0628*(Abs(v_0629) + v_0011)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 44.200</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Superseded tributary-eccentricity basis (D-070); comparison only [kip-in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0631 = v_0567*v_0107*v_0112*Abs(v_0622 - v_0109)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0631 = v_0567*v_0107*v_0112*Abs(v_0622 - v_0109)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.211</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Rigid-body axial redistribution; sign taken to increase the ring force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0632 = v_0628 + v_0631" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0632 = v_0628 + v_0631</expbody>
        <expresult> = 14.944</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 design force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0633 = v_0114/v_0632" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0633 = v_0114/v_0632</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.361</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Compare with the kern limit [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0634 = v_0632/v_0073" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0634 = v_0632/v_0073</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.184</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 qavg [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0635 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0635 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.013</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 qmoment [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0636 = v_0634 + v_0635" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0636 = v_0634 + v_0635</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.196</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 qmax [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0637 = v_0634 - v_0635" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0637 = v_0634 - v_0635</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.171</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 qmin [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0638 = v_0636*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0638 = v_0636*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.233</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Peak pressure over full radial strip [kip-in/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0639 = v_0636*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0639 = v_0636*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.254</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 root shear [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0640 = Sqrt(6*v_0638/(v_0040*v_0035))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0640 = Sqrt(6*v_0638/(v_0040*v_0035))</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.167</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 thickness bending [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0641 = v_0639/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0641 = v_0639/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.009</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 thickness shear [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0642 = Max(v_0640, v_0641, v_0037 + 0.0625)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0642 = Max(v_0640, v_0641, v_0037 + 0.0625)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.375</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Bending, shear and conservative weld-edge allowance; revise/recalculate after selecting thickness [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0643 = v_0638/v_0034" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0643 = v_0638/v_0034</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.467</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Top/bottom weld couple separated conservatively by plate thickness [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0644 = Sqrt((v_0639/2)^2 + v_0643^2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0644 = Sqrt((v_0639/2)^2 + v_0643^2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.484</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Per fillet: half vertical shear + full radial couple force [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0645 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0644/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0645 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0644/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.083</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 3 weld strength leg [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0646 = Max(v_0645, v_0085)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0646 = Max(v_0645, v_0085)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Strength and minimum detailing; revise/recalculate after selecting weld [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0647 = Round(16*v_0646, 0)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0647 = Round(16*v_0646, 0)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 4.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Nearest whole number of sixteenths [—]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0648 = If(v_0647 &gt;= 16*v_0646, v_0647, v_0647 + 1)/16" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0648 = If(v_0647 &gt;= 16*v_0646, v_0647, v_0647 + 1)/16</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Trial leg rounded up to the next 1/16 in [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0649 = v_0092 + (4 - 1)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0649 = v_0092 + (4 - 1)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 199.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 x [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0650 = v_0092 + (4 - 1.5)*v_0006" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0650 = v_0092 + (4 - 1.5)*v_0006</expbody>
        <expresult> = 169.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 lo [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0651 = v_0002" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0651 = v_0002</expbody>
        <expresult> = 219.000</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 hi [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0652 = v_0651 - v_0650" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0652 = v_0651 - v_0650</expbody>
        <expresult> = 49.500</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 width [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0653 = v_0652*v_0566*v_0003/1728" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0653 = v_0652*v_0566*v_0003/1728</expbody>
        <expresult> = 64.827</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 volume [ft³]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0654 = v_0021*v_0653" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0654 = v_0021*v_0653</expbody>
        <expresult> = 9.724</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 service [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0655 = v_0022*v_0654" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0655 = v_0022*v_0654</expbody>
        <expresult> = 12.155</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0656 = (v_0650 + v_0651)/2 - v_0649" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0656 = (v_0650 + v_0651)/2 - v_0649</expbody>
        <expresult> = -5.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Retained for whole-wall equilibrium; carried by the wall, not the ring [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0657 = v_0655*(Abs(v_0656) + v_0011)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0657 = v_0655*(Abs(v_0656) + v_0011)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 100.279</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Superseded tributary-eccentricity basis (D-070); comparison only [kip-in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0658 = v_0567*v_0107*v_0112*Abs(v_0649 - v_0109)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0658 = v_0567*v_0107*v_0112*Abs(v_0649 - v_0109)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.633</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Rigid-body axial redistribution; sign taken to increase the ring force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0659 = v_0655 + v_0658" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0659 = v_0655 + v_0658</expbody>
        <expresult> = 12.788</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 design force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0660 = v_0114/v_0659" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0660 = v_0114/v_0659</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.422</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Compare with the kern limit [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0661 = v_0659/v_0073" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0661 = v_0659/v_0073</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.157</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 qavg [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0662 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0662 = v_0114*v_0070/v_0074</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.013</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 qmoment [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0663 = v_0661 + v_0662" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0663 = v_0661 + v_0662</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.170</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 qmax [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0664 = v_0661 - v_0662" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0664 = v_0661 - v_0662</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.144</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 qmin [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0665 = v_0663*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0665 = v_0663*((v_0070^3 - v_0072^3)/(3*v_0068) - (v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.202</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Peak pressure over full radial strip [kip-in/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0666 = v_0663*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0666 = v_0663*(v_0070^2 - v_0072^2)/(2*v_0068)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.220</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 root shear [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0667 = Sqrt(6*v_0665/(v_0040*v_0035))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0667 = Sqrt(6*v_0665/(v_0040*v_0035))</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.156</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 thickness bending [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0668 = v_0666/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0668 = v_0666/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.008</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 thickness shear [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0669 = Max(v_0667, v_0668, v_0037 + 0.0625)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0669 = Max(v_0667, v_0668, v_0037 + 0.0625)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.375</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Bending, shear and conservative weld-edge allowance; revise/recalculate after selecting thickness [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0670 = v_0665/v_0034" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0670 = v_0665/v_0034</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.404</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Top/bottom weld couple separated conservatively by plate thickness [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0671 = Sqrt((v_0666/2)^2 + v_0670^2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0671 = Sqrt((v_0666/2)^2 + v_0670^2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.418</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Per fillet: half vertical shear + full radial couple force [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0672 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0671/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0672 = v_0071 + Sqrt(2)*v_0671/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.080</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 weld strength leg [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0673 = Max(v_0672, v_0085)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0673 = Max(v_0672, v_0085)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.250</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Strength and minimum detailing; revise/recalculate after selecting weld [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
